OL,3,GBLOOPERSCSound fault delays start of
OL,4,CITV Evening News
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe start of tonight's edition of the
OL,7,FITV Evening News was delayed by a few
OL,8,Fminutes due to a sound fault.
OL,10,FThe problem was apparent during the
OL,11,Fshort preview of the programme
OL,12,Fimmediately after the regional news,
OL,13,Fwhich went out minus sound.
OL,15,FImmediately after the short ad break,
OL,16,Fan animating ITV News logo appeared
OL,17,Fbriefly before being replaced by ITV's
OL,18,Fstandard breakdown graphic.
OL,23,EPub: 30-Oct-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,145,140,200,120,0,100
PN,14402
SC,0002
