PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F144A1794406344
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G2/2
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GBLOOPERSCSound fault delays start of
OL,4,CITV Evening News
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe live announcer made a number of
OL,7,Fverbal apologies (one of which clashed
OL,8,Fwith the brief pre-recorded
OL,9,Fannouncement that's baked into the
OL,10,Fbreakdown graphic loop).
OL,12,FThree minutes later, the programme
OL,13,Fstarted, with the opening headlines as
OL,14,Fnormal.
OL,16,FBefore linking into the top story,
OL,17,Fpresenter Mary Nightingale apologised
OL,18,Ffor the issues:
OL,20,F"Good evening and thank you for
OL,21,Fsticking with us ` we are now on air."
OL,23,EPub: 30-Oct-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,145,140,200,120,0,100
